message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "verified-iot-fusion: verified LLM-assisted feature engineering for heterogeneous IoT streams"
abstract: >-
  A research artifact in which an LLM proposes feature programs in a constrained DSL and a
  compiler checks types, units, lineage, temporal eligibility, and resource bounds before
  execution.
